**By adopting ND-inspired architectural patterns, modular multi-agent frameworks, dynamic orchestration strategies, emotional intelligence, inclusive UX, and rigorous ethical standards—AI agents evolve not just as smarter tools, but as partners in co-creating the future.** This vision is within reach—empowered by emerging tools, frameworks, and most importantly, by centering the lived experiences and innovative strategies of neurodivergent individuals at every stage.

